PSIHELP: Psionic help shortcut and category

Syntax: psihelp
        psihelp <topic>
        help psihelp

DESCRIPTION:
  Opens psionic help. With no argument, shows the full psionics overview.
  With a topic, shows help for that psionic command or power.

  Examples:
    psihelp
    psihelp psi
    psihelp telepathy
    psihelp psionics

  Typing "help psihelp" (rather than running the psihelp command) lists
  every individual psionic power topic in one category, the same way
  "help skills" lists skills. Psionic powers are not filed under the
  general skills category; they live under psihelp.

NOTES:
  The psihelp command is a shortcut for help psionics and related
  psionic topics. You must have psionic access through your race or
  OCC to use psi powers.
  For this file itself when the "help psihelp" bare word is claimed by
  the category listing, type: help psihelp overview

